[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27303.27, "timestamp": "07:35:03", "text": "等等，不對。那很好，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27321.43, "timestamp": "07:35:21", "text": "我做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27326.548, "timestamp": "07:35:26", "text": "巧克力上的洞真漂亮。  什麼洞？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27339.43, "timestamp": "07:35:39", "text": "，看起來我沒有洞。不，我應該……我為什麼之前沒想到要這樣做呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27352.59, "timestamp": "07:35:52", "text": "？總之，謝謝大家。我要把牠吃掉。斷裂的那部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27355.75, "timestamp": "07:35:55", "text": "啊"}]